      "name": "Currywurst",
      "what": "Sliced pork sausage smothered in curried ketchup — Berlin's iconic street food",
      "tip": "Best from a Imbiss (street kiosk) with a plastic fork and chips (Pommes). Curry 36 in Berlin is legendary."
